## Schedule

Classes meet Tuesday and Thursday, 11:00a–12:20p, in PH A21A. Tuesdays are for the
chapter and the question it raises; Thursdays open with the data draw and then
run the lab. Read the assigned chapter **before** Tuesday, and post your data
slide **before** Thursday. Your board post is due **Friday, 11:59 p.m.**

